# Vendored Helm chart dependencies (charts/*.tgz).
#
# ADR-014 originally gitignored these (like node_modules), committing only Chart.lock.
# GitOps amends that: ArgoCD's repo-server runs `helm dependency build` only at the top
# level (not recursively), so multi-level local deps (vortex -> orders -> common) fail to
# render unless the vendored .tgz are present in git. We therefore commit them so ArgoCD
# gets self-contained, renderable sources. Future: publish `common` as an OCI chart to ECR
# to drop the binaries from git again (see ADR-019).
